# UI copy: no internal guidance

Do **not** put prompts, implementation notes, or agent guidance into the product UI.

Forbidden in labels, descriptions, placeholders, helper text, toasts, empty states:
- How the system works internally (`archive.xxx`, `devices[]`, `answers`, schema, reserved keys)
- Tips that teach the developer/agent workflow (“建议改用…”, “将渲染为…”, “采集员填写时…”)
- Architecture warnings meant for maintainers

UI copy should be short business language only. Keep technical notes in code comments, rules, or specs—not on screen.
